# 节点需求表：显示名|候选路径(逗号分隔，任一存在即通过)
# customize.sh 调 validate_nodes.sh 逐行硬校验，任何一行全缺失 = 安装中止。
# 改动机型节点时只改这里，校验脚本不用动。
风扇开关|/sys/kernel/fan/fan_enable
风扇档位|/sys/kernel/fan/fan_speed_level,/sys/kernel/fan_speed_level
液冷开关|/proc/driver/micropump/enable
液冷频率|/proc/driver/micropump/freq
液冷转速|/proc/driver/micropump/speed
电池容量|/sys/class/power_supply/battery/capacity
电池温度|/sys/class/power_supply/battery/temp
电池电流|/sys/class/power_supply/battery/current_now
电池电压|/sys/class/power_supply/battery/voltage_now
充电器在线(AC)|/sys/class/power_supply/ac/online,/sys/class/power_supply/ucsi-source-psy-*/online,/sys/class/power_supply/policy/online,/sys/class/power_supply/usb/online
充电器在线(USB)|/sys/class/power_supply/usb/online
限流节点|/sys/class/qcom-battery/restrict_cur
充电使能|/sys/class/qcom-battery/charging_enabled
电池充电使能|/sys/class/qcom-battery/battery_charging_enabled
温控配置|/vendor/etc/thermal-engine.conf
CPU 频率节点|/sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu*/cpufreq/scaling_max_freq
GPU 频率节点|/sys/class/kgsl/kgsl-3d0/devfreq/max_freq,/sys/class/kgsl/kgsl-3d0/max_gpuclk
背光节点|/sys/class/backlight/*/brightness
背光最大亮度|/sys/class/backlight/*/max_brightness
降温设备目录|/sys/class/thermal
触控-跟手速度|/proc/touchscreen/follow_hand_level
触控-稳定程度|/proc/touchscreen/stability_level
触控-灵敏程度|/proc/touchscreen/sensibility
触控-上报频率|/proc/touchscreen/tp_report_rate
触控-边缘防抖|/proc/touchscreen/edge_report_limit
